			"notes": "### 基础功能：玩家手持幸运图腾破坏方块、击杀生物、进食时会有一定概率获得60秒的随机正向Buff，手持幸运图腾死亡后也会获得强于不死图腾的效果。\nBasic functions: When the player holds the Totem of Luck to destroy blocks, kill creatures, and eat, there is a certain probability to get a random positive buff for 60 seconds, and the effect of holding the Lucky Totem will also be stronger than Totem of Undying after dying.\n### 支持版本 Supported versions：\n- **Fabric 1.19.3 / 1.19.4 / 1.20.1 / 1.20.2 / 1.20.3 / 1.20.4 / 1.21.1**（需要 Fabric Loader 0.16.14 以及上版本，Fabric API任意版本）。\n  (requires Fabric Loader 0.16.14 or higher, any version of Fabric API).\n\n- **Forge 1.20.1**（需要 Forge Loader 47 及以上版本）。\n  (requires Forge Loader 47 or higher).\n\n- **NeoForge 1.21.1** （需要NeoForge 21.1.216 及以上版本）。\n  (requires NeoForge 21.1.216 or higher.)"
